<title>NEW ZEALAND: Tower NZ reports 11.4 pct return in June year.</title>
<headline>Tower NZ reports 11.4 pct return in June year.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand fund manager Tower said on Thursday that its Balanced fund returned an 11.4 percent return after tax and fees for the June year.</p>
<p>The performance was mainly the result of strong performances by share markets. The New Zealand market increased by 27 percent in the year and the U.S. market by 30 percent.</p>
<p>Tower Managing Director Stuart Fish said there was nervousness that world share markets were overvalued and last year's performance would not be repeated.</p>
</text>
